## Description

"Map of Meanings deals with the meanings and practices of everyday life, in other words with the way daily activities and rituals, for example TV watching, cooking and eating, greeting or celebrating are dealt with in different cultures."

## About Map of Meanings

The Map of Meanings series explores cross-cultural perspectives on everyday activities and rituals. The project examines how different cultures approach and赋予意义 to common daily practices such as:
- Television watching
- Cooking and eating
- Greeting rituals
- Celebrations and ceremonies

